{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106426","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106426/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106426/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106426/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106426","id":3064805606,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6WQHw9","number":106426,"title":"Register `DOCK_SLOT_BOTTOM` with `EditorDockManager`","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-05-15T03:48:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-21T20:53:24Z","closed_at":"2025-11-21T20:53:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106426","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106426.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106426.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"See: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12430\r\nDepends on: #106164\r\n\r\nThis PR creates a new value in the DockSlot enum, `DOCK_SLOT_BOTTOM`. This change allows the `Move to Bottom` button to be replaced with a button that is more in line with the rest of the docks:\r\n<img width=\"180\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7298d786-c954-4c37-a897-b5f3004f304a\" />\r\n\r\nThis allows the FileSystem dock to move to the bottom (same as master), and notifies it by calling the preexisting `_set_dock_horizontal` method (introduced in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/86765) to allow panels to optionally change to a horizontal layout.\r\n\r\nThis PR temporarily disallows native bottom panels from moving to the other dock panels, which is intended to be amended in future PRs. Additionally, dragging tabs to and from the bottom dock is disallowed because right now we are unable to verify that the drop is correct and notify the docks to change their layout, that is the subject of another PR.\r\n\r\nThere are two commits in this PR. One is a mirror of #106164 that is only included so that this will compile and will be deleted once #106164 is merged. The second is the actual content of this PR.\r\n\r\nTodo:\r\n- [x] Deprecate Bottom Panel methods in EditorPlugin (and the relevant methods in EditorBottomPanel)\r\n- [ ] Update to use EditorDock, respect DockLayout\r\n- [x] Change EditorSettings Shortcuts to move all the bottom panel shortcuts under dock.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106426/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106426/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}